Hashing
---------
- Hashing is a technique used to:
    Store data quickly
    Search data quickly
    Access data in near constant time
-It converts data into a unique numeric value called a hash value using a hash
function.

- Hashing helps convert the key into a number (index) so the value can be stored and found quickly.

